{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"只写了喜欢值得保留、惦念增加和逐渐难以收住的心理变化，没有把珠子的感官比喻写成真实往事或动作，也没有音乐术语或小节号。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"把无法让美好时刻停住转化为对亲近持续时间缺乏把握的心理认识，没有把时间流逝写成真实外部事件或音乐变化造成的心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"写的是想把喜欢留在心里、又不愿被回应欲支配的自我约束，没有新增人物关系、具体场景或珠子中的比喻性动作。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"写的是越来越希望关心被理解、同时克制自己不催促对方的内在拉扯，没有添加对白、外部事件或具体人物行动。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S06-3既写出把喜欢留在心里的甜，也写出盼回应的念头会回来，足以支撑他舍不得淡化喜欢、惦念反复并逐渐难以收住。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S06-4已经写出害怕眼前的亲近留不住，能解释这种担忧继续存在，但没有明确给出他为何意识到自己无法决定亲近能持续多久。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S06-1说明再多付出也证明不了自己什么都不求，能支撑他不愿被回应欲牵着走，却没有直接说明他为何还想把喜欢留在心里。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S06-3明确写出盼回应的念头暂时消退后又回来，足以引出他重新渴望关心被对方领会。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S04-1已经说明他怕追着要回应会搅坏眼前的亲近、对方也没有承诺过什么，因此能解释他此处仍不催促对方并自行消化期待。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线也能看出喜欢逐渐加深并难以控制，他又开始担心亲近无法长久，因而一面希望对方理解自己，一面克制索取回应的冲动。前后心理变化连贯，不需要借助珠子才能理解。 \",\n  \"lost\": [],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "67c2b587-9824-48fd-96b4-e5823aa9b859", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T224231610603Z", "elapsed_seconds": 155.703, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T22:45:07.325387+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "67a0f4d2baba26445452a95241a038e7466973fa39b50154443fdf8de917efd2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T224231610603Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "03994e9f75cf994ec0cb9f267da92bf52facac3c8f09bd6fbbae2f7f90b93649"}}}
